# A revision pin cannot be tracked: writing HEAD into a file changes the
# tree, which changes the hash, so the committed value is stale the moment it
# lands -- and it reads as authoritative. Found reading 37f8bdf at HEAD 22c3bc5,
# two commits behind the fix a campaign was about to test AGAINST it. Generated
# at read time instead.
.vit_rev
